    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "PIKACHU! Try to keep up!\n",
        "You need to dazzle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 218\n",
        "Canalave City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 218\n",
        "Jubilife City"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "These stone conduits... They aren’t\n",
        "natural. They match the energy\r",
        "relays my father’s people built."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s impossible.\n",
        "They were disbanded years ago."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Wait... You’ve been talking to\n",
        "that Cyrus guy again, haven’t you?\r",
        "He’s the one sending you after\n",
        "the Totems."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Don’t trust him. He knows too much\n",
        "about these rifts to be a scholar.\r",
        "Maybe he’s the reason they’re\n",
        "opening."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Still... If the Totems hold the\n",
        "rifts open, maybe their energy\r",
        "could be used instead of sealed.\r",
        "Forget I said that. I’ll find my\n",
        "own answers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000510_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "The old machinery gives off a\n",
        "faint, rhythmic vibration.\r",
        "The nearby flowers lean toward it."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
